s14:s10,s13:eqtrd |- ( ( C e. CC /\ ( R e. CC /\ T e. CC ) ) -> ( ( R + ( _i x. R ) ) + ( T + ( _i x. T ) ) ) = ( ( R + T ) + ( _i x. ( R + T ) ) ) )
